    "format": "markdown",
    "text": "# Valley Water Board Annual Report\n\nThe board supplied drinking water to eleven thousand households this year. Leakage fell for the third consecutive year after the pipe renewal programme.\n\n## Finances\n\nOperating costs were covered entirely by water charges and connection fees.\n\n## Outlook\n\nNext year the board will replace the Millbrook pumping station."
